{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 16, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人性", "id": "人性"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "內", "id": "內"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "戕賊", "id": "戕賊"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "杞柳", "id": "杞柳"}, {"form": "桮棬", "id": "桮棬"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "熟", "id": "熟"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.4275373196539396, "source": "義", "target": "桮棬"}, {"weight": 1.2452157628599851, "source": "義", "target": "人性"}, {"weight": 1.7152193921057206, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.7343901390939943, "source": "義", "target": "杞柳"}, {"weight": 1.2452157628599851, "source": "義", "target": "戕賊"}, {"weight": 1.2452157628599851, "source": "義", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.6506808709681495, "source": "義", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.4275373196539396, "source": "義", "target": "內"}, {"weight": 1.6506808709681495, "source": "義", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.9383629434199305, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.343828051528095, "source": "義", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 1.4816045409242156, "source": "人性", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "人性", "target": "杞柳"}, {"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "人性", "target": "桮棬"}, {"weight": 2.9368917735310576, "source": "人性", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "信", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6639260977181702, "source": "內", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.8870696490323797, "source": "內", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 2.5